# Fixed defect 133's last rows, 2026-10-02 (the audit's 133-a-fswap2,
# 133-m-const_alone and 133-m-fn_alone), a declaration whose head holds a
# word the lexer refused, with nothing below it. Symptom: `fn` and `const`
# alone, and `function f() fn`, each cost `reserved_word` alone, and the
# body or the value the declaration lacked was told only once the word was
# mended, `const` over `constant MAX: i64` costing `missing_body` then: two
# turns for one declaration. So did `record P fn`, `extern "m.h" fn`, `$`
# or `let` after a function's head, and `if true fn` over a line at its
# margin. Cause: the parser stays silent where the lexer spoke, and that
# silence covered the declaration's own lack: a word alone whose swap is no
# certain one there was dropped with its line and nothing asked of what it
# declares, and a head whose line ended at a refused token asked its body
# at that token. Now a word alone is told what the declaration its swap
# names owes below it (`selfhost/parse/decl.hero`, `bodiless_word`;
# `selfhost/parse/refused_heads.hero`, `declares`), and a head whose line
# goes on into a refused token is one that refused something
# (`selfhost/parse/opening.hero`, `selfhost/parse/members_below.hero`), its
# body named missing at the next line, its members at its head. Over a body
# the word is the one report still, and `class`, whose word swaps for
# nothing, is told alone.

fn  #~ reserved_word
const  #~ missing_body reserved_word

def  #~ missing_body reserved_word
struct  #~ missing_body reserved_word empty_record
enum  #~ reserved_word empty_variant
class  #~ reserved_word

function stub() fn  #~ reserved_word
function dollar() $  #~ missing_body unexpected_character
function bound() let  #~ missing_body reserved_word
record P fn  #~ missing_body reserved_word empty_record
constant K: i64 fn  #~ reserved_word
extern "m.h" fn  #~ missing_body reserved_word expected_extern_block

function over_a_body() fn  #~ reserved_word
    print(1)

function at_the_margin()
    if true fn  #~ reserved_word
    print(1)  #~ missing_body

function main()
    print(1)

#~v reserved_word
fn  #~v missing_body
